{"articleNo":"151035","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=151035&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 2016 구미아시아연극제 금오공대 초청공연 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.05.12","hit":"11069","attachments":[{"name":"2016년 구미아시아연극제 안내자료.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=151035&attachNo=22910"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img style=\"HEIGHT: 879px; WIDTH: 582px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/6f0101c2-ab92-4e0c-87b4-c30194989cbf.jpg\" width=\"721\" height=\"1010\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 매해 다양한&nbsp;유수의 작품으로&nbsp;구미시 공연예술문화를 풍성하게 장식하고 있는&nbsp;<em><strong>구미아시아연극제</strong></em>가 올해 제 7회를 맞이하며, 공식공연 중 <strong>개막작 &lt;무처안방&gt;</strong> 공연이&nbsp;우리대학에서 열립니다. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 우리대학구성원과 구미시민이면 누구나 참여 가능하며, 이번 2016 구미아시아연극제를 통해 해외&nbsp;우수공연을 가까이에서 만나볼 수&nbsp;있는 기회를 가져보시기 바랍니다. &nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 공연제목 : <strong>무처안방(</strong></span></span><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">無處安放/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">우추안팡</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 공연일시 : <font color=\"#0055ff\"><strong>2016. 5. 18.(수) 19:30~ </strong></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 공연장소 : <font color=\"#0055ff\"><strong>금오공과대학교 본관 강당</strong></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 르 : 연극</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□&nbsp;극&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 단&nbsp;: 중국강소성연예집단화극원</span></span></p></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ 입&nbsp;장 &nbsp;료 : 전석무료(티켓 지참필수)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 티켓은 <u><font color=\"#ff00dd\">학생처 학생복지팀(학생회관 101호)에서 수령</font></u> 가능합니다. </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
